  "post_title": "Manu Llorens guanya la lliga 1ª divisió de billar Druida, a Onda, i Marc Richard, la copa CRISTACER",
  "post_date": "2015-04-30 07:51:11",
  "post_name": "manu-llorens-guanya-la-lliga-1%c2%aa-divisio-de-billar-druida-a-onda-i-marc-richard-la-copa-cristacer",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Manu Llorens Porcar ha guanyat la lliga de billar de 1&ordf; divisi&oacute; que s&#39;ha disputat a Cafeteria Druida, del carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda, entre setembre 2014 i abril 2015. Marc Richard Boyle ha sigut campi&oacute; de la XII edici&oacute; de la copa CRISTACER.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_3692.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En lliga falta per acabar la 2&ordf; divisi&oacute; i la modalitat de parelles.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/MarcRichardBoyleCampioCopaCristacerDruidaBillar.jpg\" style=\"height: 360px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En XII edici&oacute; de la copa CRISTACER, el jugador Marc Richard Boyle, d&#39;Almassora,&nbsp;s&#39;ha imposat a la final a Juanjo Flores, de Vinar&ograve;s, per un ajustat 10-9. Abans havia superat al jugador onder Pablo D&iacute;az (9-3), en la semifinal. Marc, que venia de la part m&eacute;s complicada del quadrant, tamb&eacute; va guanyar a Sergio Dual (8-2) en&nbsp;quats de final, a Manu Llorens (7-4) en&nbsp;vuitens de final i a Edu Morell&oacute; (6-0) de Vila-real en setzens de final.</p>\n<p>D&#39;aquesta manera, l&#39;angl&egrave;s Marc Richar Boyle&nbsp;se suma a la llista de vencedors de la copa CRISTACER junt a Israel Quevedo(1), Toni Al&ograve;s (3), Manu Llorens (2), Sergio Dual (2), Gaizka D&iacute;az de Argote (2) i Jes&uacute;s Balaguer (1). El semifinalistes s&oacute;n el ja mencionat Pablo D&iacute;az i Sergio S&aacute;nchez, de la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3672.jpg\" alt=\"img_3672\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3674.jpg\" alt=\"img_3674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3675.jpg\" alt=\"img_3675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3676.jpg\" alt=\"img_3676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3680.jpg\" alt=\"img_3680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3682.jpg\" alt=\"img_3682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3683.jpg\" alt=\"img_3683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3684.jpg\" alt=\"img_3684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3685.jpg\" alt=\"img_3685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3687.jpg\" alt=\"img_3687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3689.jpg\" alt=\"img_3689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/img_3692.jpg\" alt=\"img_3692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliga1adivisiocopabillar14-15druidaonda/1.jpg\" alt=\"1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-